start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc 15dc@ring ss@top
R2: {3ch=dc dc}@same 2dc@same dc 2dc@same [2dc@same 2dc@same dc 2dc@same]x3 ss@top # TLO: 2nd inc + dc of each side
R3: {3ch=dc dc}@same 2dc@same 3dc 2dc@same 2dc@same [2dc@same 2dc@same 3dc 2dc@same 2dc@same]x3 ss@top # TLO: middle inc, 3dc, inc
R4: {3ch=dc dc}@same 2dc@same 7dc 2dc@same 2dc@same [2dc@same 2dc@same 7dc 2dc@same 2dc@same]x3 ss@top # TLO: middle inc, 7dc, inc
R5: {3ch=dc dc}@same 2dc@same 11dc 2dc@same 2dc@same [2dc@same 2dc@same 11dc 2dc@same 2dc@same]x3 ss@top # TLO: middle inc, 11dc, inc
R6: ch sc 18sc [{sc 2ch sc}@same 18sc]x3 {sc 2ch}@same ss@top # TLO on the 18sc
R7: ch sc 19sc 4sc@sp [20sc 4sc@sp]x3 ss@top
